# The reproduced decimal.js test suite must stay byte-for-byte identical to
# upstream, so git must never translate its line endings in either direction.
tests/original/** -text

# It is also third-party code, not this port's, and at 2.4 MB it is most of the
# repository by size. Marking it vendored keeps GitHub's language statistics
# describing the port rather than the suite it is measured against. The files
# themselves stay exactly where they are: they are the proof.
tests/original/** linguist-vendored

# Expected values produced by running decimal.js, not written by hand.
src/testdata/** linguist-generated

# The adapter, fuzzer and benchmark scripts are deliberately left counted. They
# are JavaScript this port wrote, and hiding them would flatter the numbers.
